summary: Test partner repository creation
description: |
  Verify that radii creates radii-nvidia-partner.repo in /etc/yum.repos.d
  during install when the --partner-repo flag is given and subscription
  manager is configured.  The generated file must contain the correct
  section name, architecture-specific base URL, GPG key, and SSL
  certificate paths extracted from redhat.repo.  In read-only mode
  (list), the file must not be written.  Without the flag, or with
  --skip-subscriptions, the file must not be created.  Also verifies
  the config command for persisting partner-repos settings.
order: 36
